    rdfs:comment "x is a proper part of y: region(x) is a proper subset of region(y) (TPP or NTPP). Grounding: region(x) = cells of x plus the cells x encloses (cells outside x not 4-connected to the grid border through cells outside x); the second argument is an object; x != y. Randell, Cui & Cohn 1992 (RCC-8)." ;
