    rdfs:label "rcc8_PPi" ;
    rdfs:comment "y is a proper part of x (inverse of PP): region(y) is a proper subset of region(x) (TPPi or NTPPi). Grounding: region(x) = cells of x plus the cells x encloses (cells outside x not 4-connected to the grid border through cells outside x); the second argument is an object; x != y. Randell, Cui & Cohn 1992 (RCC-8)." ;
